    <innerclass refid="structllvm_1_1_scalarizer_pass_options" prot="public">llvm::ScalarizerPassOptions</innerclass>
    <innerclass refid="classllvm_1_1_scalarizer_pass" prot="public">llvm::ScalarizerPass</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacellvm">llvm</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>This pass converts vector operations into scalar operations (or, optionally, operations on smaller vector widths), in order to expose optimization opportunities on the individual scalar operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It is mainly intended for targets that do not have vector units, but it may also be useful for revectorizing code to different vector widths. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
